## Load Balancer Distribution Algorithm

### Round Robin
HAProxy is configured with the **Round Robin** algorithm. It works as follows:
- Request 1 → Server 1
- Request 2 → Server 2
- Request 3 → Server 1
- Request 4 → Server 2
- ... and so on cyclically

Each server receives an equal share of requests over time. This is ideal when servers have equal capacity and request processing times are roughly uniform.

